  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fair Finance Asia (FFA) &#x2013; Phase 2 &#x2013; Bangladesh Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The country chair for FFB (Fair Finance Bangladesh) country coalition, Oxfam in Bangladesh will   -conduct a scoping study on Financial Institutions (FIs) and their Environmental, Social and Governance (ESG) compliance,   -form a strong country coalition, develop their capacity   -and, jointly as a coalition influence FIs to adopt more ESG complaint strategies</narrative>
  </description>
